    "text": "considered. Activity Fees 4.1 To issue a certificate on registration of trade individual business or firm. 1. Business equal or above Rs. 250,000 Rs. 2,500.00 2. Business equal or above Rs. 100,000 Rs. 1,500.00 3. Business equal or above Rs. 50,000 Rs. 1,000.00 4. Business below Rs.50,000 Rs. 500.00 4.2 To issue revision declaration presented under sec. 5 1. Business equal or above Rs. 250,000 Rs. 1,000.00 2. Business below Rs. 250,000 Rs. 750.00 4.3 Application fee for inspecting particulars 1. Business equal or above Rs. 250,000 Rs. 500.00 2. Business below Rs. 250,000 Rs. 250.00 4.4 Fee to obtain certified copy of registration 1. Business equal or above Rs. 250,000 Rs. 1,000.00 2. Business below Rs. 250,000 Rs. 750.00 4.5 Recovery lapsed Fees on Registration of Business An application should be supplied as per the specimen depicted under the sec.2 herein in order to be registered within 30 days followed by the initiation of the business. Accordingly, lapsed fees should be recovered at the occasions in which the said 30 days period is exceeded. An amount similar to business registration fee and a lapsed penalty fee of Rs. 2,500 in addition should be paid during 31 - 90 days from the initiation of the business. Businesses which have already lapsed more than 91 days shall not be registered whatsoever.",
